From 758867f7c7a7d512abe027b6ab43041b597d09be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoXider <neoxider@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 16:14:54 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] cq: compressed BF16 weight types (Huffman exponent,
 4/3-bit exponent window) with fused CUDA GEMV

- GGML_TYPE_CQ_BF16H (lossless, exponent Huffman + companion tensor), CQ_BF16W4 (fixed 12.125 bit,
  lossless with escape list), CQ_BF16W3 (11.125 bit, lossy)
- CUDA: batch-1 GEMV decodes inside the kernel and reproduces the summation order of the BF16
  mul_mat_vec_f kernel (bit-identical outputs); batch > 1 decodes into a BF16 scratch buffer
- loader: companion tensors <name>.cqx linked via tensor->extra; CPU get_rows
- tools: llama-cq-convert, llama-cq-logits, llama-cq-kbench
